<title>USA: Premedent enters deal with confectionary company.</title>
<headline>Premedent enters deal with confectionary company.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Premedent Technology Inc, a licensing corporation for oral therapeutics, said it entered into an option and development agreement with a world leader in confectionery products to develop and license a line of oral therapeutics.</p>
<p>Further details and terms were not disclosed, but the company said the deal is believed to be worth millions of dollars.</p>
</text>
